    <string name="guide_title">t_wave Bluetooth Speaker Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_body">A2DP Sink Mode (Requires Root):\n• Uses superuser (su) to enable bluetooth.profile.a2dp.sink.enabled, avrcp.controller, and Loudspeaker CoD (0x240414), then restarts the Bluetooth stack.\n• Pair any phone or PC with \"%4$s\" — it appears as a native Bluetooth Audio Speaker.\n\nRFCOMM SPP Fallback (No Root):\n• Opens SPP UUID 00001101-0000-1000-8000-00805F9B34FB for raw little-endian PCM streaming.\n• Active PCM Profile: %1$s (%2$d bytes/stereo frame) • %3$s</string>
    <string name="guide_copy_python">Copy Python Sender</string>
    <string name="guide_copied_python">Copied Python script</string>
    <string name="guide_close">Close</string>
    <string name="a2dp_root_note">Native Bluetooth Speaker (A2DP Sink 0x110B) requires root (su) privilege to modify system Bluetooth profile properties &amp; Class of Device. Use RFCOMM SPP mode for unrooted senders.</string>

